# A recipe's render (tools/make_manual.py --renders): from P8, headphones, Pitch lock off, Scene time 0.
# "# @" marks the listening times (tools/make_manual.py --times).
notips
phones 1
set 74 0
set 71 0
tapkey w7
tap PLAY
wait 2500
tap FX
turn K2 -100 10
wait 500
tap ARP
turn K1 45 60
wait 1500
wav swell.wav
# @ P8 Sibyl, its delay off and its Swell quick: the drones breathe about once a second
wait 1500
tap LFO
# @ LFO I to Square on both cutoffs (key 8 twice: LFO I on drone II's too), about as fast: the filters jump in turn
tap OCT-
tapkey b7
tapkey b7
turn K2 15 60
turn K4 40 60
turn SELECT 40 50
wait 4000
# @ hold key 5: the LFO locked to the Swell, so each jump lands on its breath
key b4 down
wait 700
key b4 up
wait 4500
shot swell-0.png
tap ARP
wait 400
shot swell-1.png
wait 3000
wavstop
